# The image build runs `COPY . .` over this directory (infra/Dockerfile.web), so anything left
# here by local development would otherwise be baked into the build — and a stale generated file
# under .next/ fails `pnpm build` inside the image even when the same build passes on the host.

# Installed in the image's own deps stage; the host's copy carries pnpm symlinks and
# host-architecture binaries that must not overwrite it.
node_modules

# Build output — regenerated by the image's own `pnpm build`.
.next
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# Test and tooling artifacts that have no place in a production image.
test-results
playwright-report
e2e
.playwright

# Local environment and editor files.
.env
.env.*
.git
.gitignore
*.log
